    "关闭后不再执行对应的 Aegis 导航检查。系统 WebKit 的保护不受这些开关控制。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turning an option off disables that Aegis navigation check. These switches do not control system WebKit protections."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭后不再执行对应的 Aegis 导航检查。系统 WebKit 的保护不受这些开关控制。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "關閉後不再執行對應的 Aegis 導航檢查。系統 WebKit 的保護不受這些開關控制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关闭后不新增历史；已有记录继续保留，可在隐私设置中清除。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When disabled, no new history is added. Existing records remain and can be cleared in privacy settings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭后不新增历史；已有记录继续保留，可在隐私设置中清除。"
