    "私密浏览不自动保存历史和会话。主动保存的收藏、工作区、下载和分析结果会继续保留。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Private browsing does not automatically save history or sessions. Bookmarks, workspaces, downloads and analysis results you choose to save remain stored."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "私密浏览不自动保存历史和会话。主动保存的收藏、工作区、下载和分析结果会继续保留。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "私密瀏覽不自動儲存歷史和工作階段。主動儲存的書籤、工作區、下載和分析結果會繼續保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
