    "网址检查基于本地规则，不能保证识别所有风险。网页内容仍由系统 WebKit 加载。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "URL checks use local rules and cannot detect every risk. Pages are loaded by system WebKit."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网址检查基于本地规则，不能保证识别所有风险。网页内容仍由系统 WebKit 加载。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
