    "网站专用设置优先。脚本和桌面模式在重新载入后生效，弹窗与媒体选项在新标签中生效。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Site settings take priority. JavaScript and desktop mode apply after reloading; popup and media options apply to new tabs."
          }
