    "记录会先备份。保留的文件可重新识别，回收站文件在清空前可以恢复。正在下载的项目需要先暂停。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Records are backed up first. Kept files can be found again, and files in trash can be restored before emptying it. Pause active downloads first."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
