    "译文由模型生成，需要核对原文。翻译和批注只有点击保存后才会保留；搜索范围仅包含已保存的资料。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Translations are generated by a model and should be checked against the original. Translations and notes are kept only after saving. Search covers saved items only."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "译文由模型生成，需要核对原文。翻译和批注只有点击保存后才会保留；搜索范围仅包含已保存的资料。"
          }
