    "距离越大，越不容易被小幅抖动触发。斜线方向不明确时不执行；按 Esc 或切换窗口可取消。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Higher distances reduce accidental gestures. Ambiguous diagonals are ignored. Press Esc or switch windows to cancel."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "距离越大，越不容易被小幅抖动触发。斜线方向不明确时不执行；按 Esc 或切换窗口可取消。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "距離越大，越不容易被小幅抖動觸發。斜線方向不明確時不執行；按 Esc 或切換窗口可取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "输入 L / R / U / D，分别代表 ← → ↑ ↓。最多 8 个方向，同一手势不能重复绑定。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter L / R / U / D for ← → ↑ ↓, up to 8 directions. Each gesture can have one binding."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
